# GMS's own figures: 210+4x% three times over 20 levels, on one enemy. The
# single target is the whole of what this skill is -- GMS keeps it for bosses,
# and Shuriken Challenge for everything else.
#
# 630ms is chosen, not measured: the frame database has no Hermit Triple Throw.
# Quad Star throws four stars in 660ms, so three is one tick less. It has to be
# this fast or faster to be worth swinging at all -- at 660 the 30ms rounding
# lands the swing on 510ms against Shuriken Challenge's 600, and this skill
# loses on one enemy as well as on eight.
name: "Triple Throw"
skill_order: 1
description: "Throw several throwing stars simultaneously."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ATTACK
job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_HERMIT
max_level: 20
required_equip_type: EQUIP_TYPE_CLAW
base_delay_ms: 630
max_enemies: 1
lines: 3
base { skill_pct: 2.14 }
per_level { skill_pct: 0.04 }
